<title>USA: Petrolite Corp Q2 net, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Petrolite Corp Q2 net, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.85		  $  0.41</p>
<p> Net			  9,700		    4,700</p>
<p> Revs		     101,080		   88,497</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,390		   11,337</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 net includes tax benefit from write-off of investment in subsidiary of $1.1 million or $0.10 a share.  </p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		     $   2.13		  $  0.70</p>
<p> Net			 24,263		    7,942</p>
<p> Revs		     195,138		  177,194</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,373		   11,335</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 six months net includes gain from sale of Singapore facility of $5.6 million or $0.49 a share and gain from Energy BioSystems option agreement of $670,000 or $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>1996 six months net includes gain from one-time tax benefit from write-off of investment in subsidiary of $1.1 million or $0.10 a share.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
